    "Every %@ break lasts %@. Stand up, stretch, refill your water.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every %@ break lasts %@. Stand up, stretch, refill your water."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada %1$@ pausa dura %2$@. Levántate, estírate y rellena tu agua."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque %1$@ pause dure %2$@. Levez-vous, étirez-vous, remplissez votre verre d'eau."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede %1$@ Pause dauert %2$@. Steh auf, streck dich, füll dein Wasser nach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every 20 minutes, look at something 20 feet away for 20 seconds. That tiny pause lets the focusing muscles in your eyes unclench.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding 20-20-20 explanation",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every 20 minutes, look at something 20 feet away for 20 seconds. That tiny pause lets the focusing muscles in your eyes unclench."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada 20 minutos, mira algo a 6 metros durante 20 segundos. Esa pequeña pausa deja que los músculos de enfoque de tus ojos se relajen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toutes les 20 minutes, regardez quelque chose à 6 mètres pendant 20 secondes. Cette petite pause permet aux muscles de mise au point de vos yeux de se relâcher."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schau alle 20 Minuten 20 Sekunden lang auf etwas in 6 Metern Entfernung. Diese kleine Pause lässt die Fokussiermuskeln deiner Augen entspannen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every minute of effort compounds over time.": {
      "comment": "Wellness overlay affirmation sentence",
