    "Long breaks should be longer than regular breaks. Pick a longer length or turn long breaks off.": {
      "comment": "Settings validation message",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Long breaks should be longer than regular breaks. Pick a longer length or turn long breaks off."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las pausas largas deben durar más que las normales. Elige una duración mayor o desactiva las pausas largas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les pauses longues doivent durer plus que les pauses normales. Choisissez une durée plus longue ou désactivez les pauses longues."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lange Pausen sollten länger als normale Pausen sein. Wähle eine größere Länge oder schalte lange Pausen aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Long stretches at a screen strain your eyes, back and focus. SuperZen sits quietly in your menu bar and paces your day with short, well-timed breaks.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding welcome step body",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Long stretches at a screen strain your eyes, back and focus. SuperZen sits quietly in your menu bar and paces your day with short, well-timed breaks."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pasar mucho tiempo frente a la pantalla cansa tus ojos, tu espalda y tu concentración. SuperZen se queda en la barra de menús y marca tu día con pausas breves y oportunas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De longues périodes devant l'écran fatiguent vos yeux, votre dos et votre concentration. SuperZen reste discrètement dans la barre des menus et rythme votre journée avec des pauses courtes et bien placées."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lange Zeit am Bildschirm belastet Augen, Rücken und Konzentration. SuperZen sitzt still in deiner Menüleiste und gliedert deinen Tag mit kurzen, gut getimten Pausen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
